response_template(all_right_assuming_x_is_a_x_anything_i_concl, "All right — assuming {arg} is a {pred}. Anything I conclude from it will be conditional on that.").
response_template(i_m_certain_x_is_a_x_is_a_fact_you_stated_di, "I'm certain: {last_goal_arg} is a {last_goal_pred} is a fact you stated directly, so I hold it as known, not inferred.").
response_template(i_m_confident_but_it_s_derived_not_given_x_i, "I'm confident but it's derived, not given: {chain}. I concluded it by applying a rule, so it's only as sound as those premises.").
response_template(i_m_genuinely_unsure_i_hold_conflicting_clai, "I'm genuinely unsure — I hold conflicting claims about {last_goal_arg}: you told me it is a {last_goal_pred} and also that it is not. Until that's resolved I can't commit either way.").
response_template(only_conditionally_x_is_a_x_holds_because_i, "Only conditionally: {last_goal_arg} is a {last_goal_pred} holds because I'm ASSUMING {hypo_idx} is a {hypo_idx2}. Drop that assumption and I'd have no ground for it.").
response_template(i_don_t_actually_think_that_i_have_no_suppor, "I don't actually think that — I have no support for {last_goal_arg} being a {last_goal_pred}, so I can't claim it either way.").
response_template(learning_that_x_is_not_a_x_that_s_the_single, "Learning that {last_goal_arg} is NOT a {last_goal_pred} — that's the single fact it rests on, so contradicting it would overturn my belief.").
response_template(nothing_simple_i_can_reach_that_another_way, "Nothing simple — I can reach that another way, so no single fact I drop would change it.").
response_template(it_hangs_on_one_premise_if_i_learned_that_x, "It hangs on one premise: if I learned that {crit} were false, I'd stop concluding {last_goal_arg} is a {last_goal_pred}.").
response_template(telling_me_which_to_trust_you_ve_claimed_bot, "Telling me which to trust — you've claimed both that {last_goal_arg} is a {last_goal_pred} and that it is not. Retract one and I'd settle on the other.").
response_template(dropping_the_assumption_i_only_conclude_x_is, "Dropping the assumption — I only conclude {last_goal_arg} is a {last_goal_pred} because I'm supposing {hypo_idx} is a {hypo_idx2}. Withdraw that and the conclusion goes with it.").
response_template(learning_whether_x_is_a_x_at_all_right_now_i, "Learning whether {last_goal_arg} is a {last_goal_pred} at all — right now I have no support either way, so any fact about it would be new ground.").
response_template(i_have_no_rule_that_would_make_anything_a_x, "I have no rule that would make anything a {pred}, so I can't say what would.").
response_template(the_easiest_way_is_to_tell_me_that_x_x_missi, "The easiest way is to tell me that {need} — {best_n} missing premise{s} via {best_rule} -> {pred}.").
response_template(that_s_just_the_number_x_with_nothing_to_do, "That's just the number {shown} with nothing to do — what would you like me to do with it?").

